# Output of `astro build` and `astro dev`, and the dependency tree they need.
# The repository root ignores `build/` only, so without this file a single
# `npm ci` in this folder leaves tens of thousands of files for `git add -A`
# to pick up. Starlight writes `.astro/` on every command.
.astro/
dist/
node_modules/

# Local Cloudflare state created by `wrangler dev` and `wrangler d1 execute`.
.wrangler/
